         * +--------------+---------------+-----------+--------------+
         * |  ai < pivot  |  ai == pivot  |     ?     |  ai > pivot  |
         * +--------------+---------------+-----------+--------------+
         *                 ^               ^           ^
         *                 |               |           |
         *                low              k          high
         *
         * Pointer k is the first index of ?-part
         * Pointer low is the first index of the central part
         * Pointer high is the first index of the right part
